The amended provisions of Article 21 (7) (including cases applied mutatis mutandis in Article 28 (4)) shall begin to apply from the year following the year in which this Act enters into force.
Article 6 (Transitional measures concerning self-help livestock funds)
Self-help livestock funds raised with compulsory contributions and self-help livestock funds raised with voluntary contributions pursuant to the previous provisions as at the time this Act enters into force shall be deemed compulsory self-help livestock funds and voluntary self-help livestock funds established pursuant to this Act, respectively.
Article 7 (Transitional measures concerning composition of board of representatives)
(1) The speaker, deputy speaker, and representatives under the previous provisions as at the time this Act enters into force shall be deemed the speaker, deputy speaker, and representatives under this Act, and their terms of office shall be the remainder of their previous terms of office.
(2) The auditor of the self-help fund management committee established for self-help livestock funds raised with compulsory contributions pursuant to the previous Article 16 as at the time this Act enters into force shall be deemed an auditor of the board of representatives under the amended provisions of Article 11 (4), and his or her term of office shall be the remainder of his or her previous term of office.
Article 8 (Transitional measures concerning self-help fund management committee)
(1) The self-help fund management committee established for self-help livestock funds raised with compulsory contributions and self-help livestock funds raised with voluntary contributions pursuant to the previous provisions of Article 15 as at the time this Act enters into force shall be deemed the compulsory self-help fund management committee and the voluntary self-help fund management committee established pursuant to the amended provisions of Articles 14 and 26, respectively.
