(3) The chairperson, vice-chairperson, and members of the self-help fund management committee established for self-help livestock funds raised with voluntary contributions pursuant to the previous Article 16 as at the time this Act enters into force shall be deemed the chairperson, vice-chairperson, and members of the voluntary self-help fund management committee under the amended provisions of Article 27, and their term of office shall be the remainder of their previous term of office.
Article 9 (Transitional Measures concerning Penalty Provisions and Administrative Fines)
The application of penalty provisions and administrative fines to an act before this Act enters into force shall be governed by the previous provisions.
Article 10 (Relationship to other statutes or regulations)
A citation of the provisions of the previous Creation and Management of Self-Help Livestock Funds Act by other statutes or regulations in force as at the time this Act enters into force shall be deemed a citation of the corresponding provisions of this Act, if any, in lieu of the previous provisions.

